Hi,

here are some updates for the new HP-path handling.

Thanks to Lydia's debugging effort, the unexpected mute of the front
jack was fixed now.

And now I also changed the hp-indep HP setup more dynamically, i.e. 
the DAC is switched at the time when the mixer enum is changed on the
fly.  In this way, you'll get no longer -EBUSY.

The patches will follow after this mail.

Both patches are now committed to topic/hda branch, and the latest
alsa-driver snapshot should include these.


thanks,

Takashi
